idelines Screenshot (1).png", "id": "3915626092078551", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296127_3915626095411884_5364719753103044987_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GrMQfJPC7lkQ7kNvwFh7fyh&_nc_oc=AdpDIk8KBGA4JQwFuaFKtKHTfWm_XLMUu3E6-C7FkJ3kvqhRaTvZZEUsBEoBncosODw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ8GxXYxfT1WB0RufLZeoMKhAn62FDmic5U82fbi5DdxA&oe=6AAC045A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Blade City Brand Assets Cover.png", "id": "1655153859945519", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310667_1655153863278852_7997685239185590787_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dmljcb9uL4wQ7kNvwHbLbB2&_nc_oc=AdrbhpSrmbfW8V_E8faUQB_UHbwhGOtfYmhhjU7b8bQRlamgtS7QTGjWKTTaP8w2F7s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI7WhcGkJuaFjWvFVUsMkCldgGvPebK2dXh6kiF_tiDJg&oe=6AAC0791"}, "display_name": "Blade City", "keywords": ["sports", "social", "sandbox", "platformer"], "long_description": "A rookie Ninja Monkey with a rusty blade, an empty wallet, and one impossible dream...to become the Master of the Blades \ud83e\udd77\n\nDodge & deflex \u2694\ufe0f in every match to win coins \ud83d\udcb0 \n\nSpend coins to upgrade blades, slay-high abilities, aura \u2728\n\nCoins also unlock mini-games across the city \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f\n\nSkate. Slice. Socialize \ud83d\udef9 \ud83c\udf54  \ud83c\udf63 \n\nGet rich\ud83d\udcb0. Get jacked \ud83d\udcaa. Throw rooftop parties \ud83c\udf89 . Flex \ud83e\udea9\n{1899581750729344}\n\n{2088024375447461}\n\nWanna help us build arena maps, blades, and expand this Ninja City? \ud83e\udd1d\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f\n\nJoin discord.gg/playbladecity\n\n{1714375429586515}", "short_description": "Become the ultimate Ninja Monkey in Blade City! \ud83e\udd77\ud83d\udc35\nYou have a blade. Everyone else has a blade. Good luck! \u2694\ufe0f"}]}, "developer_name": "Blade Lab", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bladecityvr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://bladecityvr.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Blade Lab", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/playbladecity", "website_url": "https://bladecityvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "1614607460665188"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2372246093265216"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2372246093265216"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1781905200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2372246093265216"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1713747154084551", "version": "1.0.16b"}, "id": "2403174663506544", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1713747154084551"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1789150025, "id": "1714442417348358", "version": "1.0.16", "version_code": 213, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1713747154084551"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1789148481, "id": "1714424220683511", "version": "1.0.16", "version_code": 212, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1713747154084551"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2403174663506544"}]}, "change_log": "v1.0.16 \u2014 Dye & Chopping VIP Update\nNew Mode \u2014 Chopping VIP\n\nProtect your VIP and take down the enemy VIP to win!\n\n*  VIPs have 1 life and no respawn. \n*  Teammates have 3 lives and can respawn. \n*  Each VIP starts with a one-time shield that blocks one headshot. \n\nAvailable from your Watch \u2192 Arcade Mode \u2192 Chopping VIP.\n\nNew Feature \u2014 Dye System\n\nGive your costumes a new color!\n\n*  Win a match or get at least one kill for a chance to find a Dye Ampoule in your post-match reward box. \n*  Get more Dye Ampoules from the Dye Vending Machine. \n*  Use the Dye Machine in the Clothing Shop to recolor costumes you own. \n\n\nWeekly Challenge \u2014 Cast Off\n\nPush 2 or more different players in a single match \u2014 20 times this week.\nReward: Anchor Shot ability\n\nNew Blade \u2014 Skeleton Sword\n\nBring some bone-chilling style to the arena.\nNow in the shop in 3 colors!\n\nCommunity Credit\n\nHuge shoutout to @NotChalky, whose winning design in our Blade Design Contest brought the Skeleton Sword to life!\n\nImprovements\n\nDaily Rewards\n\nDual Wield and Overcharge have joined the Daily Reward rotation.\nComplete your Daily Rewards for a chance to earn them for free!\n\nDaily Quests\n\nSome Daily Quests have been adjusted as we continue improving the system.\n\nBall Hit Direction\n\nImproved ball hit direction when striking with your blade.\nThe ball should now travel more consistently in the direction of your swing.", "created_date": 1789093654, "id": "1713747154084551", "version": "1.0.16b", "version_code": 211, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1713747154084551"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1789091966, "id": "1713727724086494", "version": "1.0.16b", "version_code": 210, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1713747154084551"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2403174663506544"}]}, "change_log": "v1.0.16 \u2014 Dye & Chopping VIP Update\nNew Mode \u2014 Chopping VIP\n\nProtect your VIP and take down the enemy VIP to win!\n\n*  VIPs have 1 life and no respawn. \n*  Teammates have 3 lives and can respawn. \n*  Each VIP starts with a one-time shield that blocks one headshot. \n\nAvailable from your Watch \u2192 Arcade Mode \u2192 Chopping VIP.\n\nNew Feature \u2014 Dye System\n\nGive your costumes a new color!\n\n*  Win a match or get at least one kill for a chance to find a Dye Ampoule in your post-match reward box. \n*  Get more Dye Ampoules from the Dye Vending Machine. \n*  Use the Dye Machine in the Clothing Shop to recolor costumes you own. \n\n\nWeekly Challenge \u2014 Cast Off\n\nPush 2 or more different players in a single match \u2014 20 times this week.\nReward: Anchor Shot ability\n\nNew Blade \u2014 Skeleton Sword\n\nBring some bone-chilling style to the arena.\nNow in the shop in 3 colors!\n\nCommunity Credit\n\nHuge shoutout to @NotChalky, whose winning design in our Blade Design Contest brought the Skeleton Sword to life!\n\nImprovements\n\nDaily Rewards\n\nDual Wield and Overcharge have joined the Daily Reward rotation.\nComplete your Daily Rewards for a chance to earn them for free!\n\nDaily Quests\n\nSome Daily Quests have been adjusted as we continue improving the system.\n\nBall Hit Direction\n\nImproved ball hit direction when striking with your blade.\nThe ball should now travel more consistently in the direction of your swing.", "created_date": 1789015615, "id": "1712845327508067", "version": "1.0.16a", "version_code": 206, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}